{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A BLAST FROM THE PAST!\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Marvelous marble runs, with a modern twist. Rollick N' Roll combines fun physics with intuitive controls to deliver a joyful puzzle experience for all ages. Expand your collection by unlocking fun vehicles and playsets, but be prepared for things to get a bit chaotic.\u00a0 <br> <br>Sometimes you just have to laugh!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Intuitive controls</strong> -\u00a0Press the button. See what happens.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Easy, medium or hard</strong> -\u00a0More vehicles means more mayhem.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfc6 Need more?</strong>\u00a0- Try some formidable time trials!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfa7 Chill tunes\u00a0</strong>- Professionally composed soundtrack by <i>Rest!\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udccb No training necessary</strong> - We hate tutorials too.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udc75 For ages 5 to 105</strong> -<strong>\u00a0</strong>Seriously, granny will love this.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630220/extras/en_oops.gif?t=1745312599\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630220?t=1745312599","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630220/c8f43324eabd05e55edf8e7a32815826bc3f2121/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745312599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630220/d05a4a07cf033de9bfa879b423dfe7e1d2d4e052/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745312599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630220/d05a4a07cf033de9bfa879b423dfe7e1d